# --- Supabase Edge Function Secrets (set via CLI, NOT committed here) ---
# FRONTEND_URL is set as a Supabase secret so OAuth always redirects to production:
# Command to set: SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN=<token> npx supabase secrets set FRONTEND_URL=https://fitpush.vercel.app --project-ref twrjigbbgioqdpwvkblo
# This controls where /oauth/authorize redirects the user for Google login + consent.

